      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Was literally just thinking about a system like this. I think worlds being able to award badges would be a pretty cool idea. Right now the only awards they can really give are avatars which with the rise of avatar search worlds are way less special now.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "643beaab555f53094cae7e26",
      "author": {
        "_id": "63882dc1f272550ad4b6b553",
